# Owner-runnable app

After an app-target change the owner should run, stage with
`./scripts/stage-app.sh` (Release) or `./scripts/stage-app.sh Debug`.

Always tell the owner to quit the running EdgeStash and open
`dist/EdgeStash.app`. The zip is always `dist/EdgeStash.zip`.

Do not point at DerivedData. Do not invent dated or feature-named zips,
`dist/build`, or a new folder layout.